          "type": "text",
          "text": "I've successfully implemented the Advanced Search with Filters and Sorting feature. Here's a summary of all the changes:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n### New Files Created\n\n1. **`src/app/[locale]/tools/page.tsx`** - Main tools page with advanced search\n2. **`src/components/ToolsPageContent.tsx`** - Client-side component handling filtering and sorting logic\n3. **`src/components/FilterBar.tsx`** - Filter UI component with category, rating, price, year, and platform filters\n4. **`src/components/SearchBar.tsx`** - Search input with debounced search and clear button\n5. **`src/components/SortDropdown.tsx`** - Sort dropdown with popularity, rating, recent, and name options\n6. **`src/components/ActiveFilters.tsx`** - Display active filter tags with remove buttons\n7. **`docs/ADVANCED_SEARCH.md`** - Documentation of new features\n\n### Modified Files\n\n1. **`src/lib/tools.ts`** - Added new metadata fields (`pricing`, `platform`) to `ToolMetadata` interface\n2. **`src/components/Navigation.tsx`** - Added \"All Tools\" link in navigation menu\n3. **`messages/en.json`** - Added `ToolsPage` translations and `tools` navigation link\n4. **`messages/ja.json`** - Added Japanese translations for tools page\n\n### Features Implemented\n\n#### Filters:\n- **Category**: Multi-select from dynamically generated categories\n- **Rating**: Filter by 4+, 3+, 2+, or 1+ stars\n- **Price Range**: All Prices, Free, Freemium, Paid\n- **Year**: Dynamically extracted from `last_updated` field\n- **Platform**: Web, Mobile, Desktop (simple detection based on category keywords)\n\n#### Sorting Options:\n- **Popularity**: Featured/sponsored first, then by rating\n- **Rating**: Highest rated first\n- **Most Recent**: Newest tools first (by `last_updated`)\n- **Name (A-Z)**: Alphabetical order\n\n#### UI Features:\n- Responsive design (desktop: horizontal filters, mobile: collapsible accordion)\n- Debounced search (300ms delay)\n- Active filter tags with remove buttons\n- \"Clear all\" button to reset filters\n- Results count display\n- Search bar with clear button and keyboard support (Escape)\n\n### How Filters/Sorting Work\n\n1. **Filter Logic**: Filters use AND logic within categories and OR logic between different filter types\n2. **Search**: Debounced input that filters by title, description, and category\n3. **Sorting**: Applied after filtering, using the selected sort option\n4. **Data Source**: Filters derive options from the actual tool data (dynamic categories, years)\n\n### Usage\n- Navigate to `/{locale}/tools` to access the advanced search page\n- Use the search bar or click on filter options\n- Combine multiple filters as needed\n- Use the sort dropdown to change the display order\n- Click individual filter tags or \"Clear all\" to reset"
